      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the congregation of the people of Israel moved on from the wilderness of Sin by stages, according to the commandment of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and camped at Rephidim; but there was no water for the people to drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore the people found fault with Moses, and said, “Give us water to drink.” And Moses said to them, “Why do you find fault with me? Why do you put the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to the proof?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 14.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But the people thirsted there for water, and the people murmured against Moses, and said, “Why did you bring us up out of Egypt, to kill us and our children and our cattle with thirst?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses cried to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", “What shall I do with this people? They are almost ready to stone me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Pass on before the people, taking with you some of the elders of Israel; and take in your hand the rod with which you struck the Nile, and go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I will stand before you there on the rock at Horeb; and you shall strike the rock, and water shall come out of it, that the people may drink.” And Moses did so, in the sight of the elders of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he called the name of the place Massah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Proof",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and Meribah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Contention",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because of the faultfinding of the children of Israel, and because they put the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to the proof by saying, “Is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " among us or not?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
